      "id": "IntendedExperience",
      "name": "IntendedExperience",
      "summary": "Automates player settings so GLS (v3/v4) lights and modcharts look the way the lighter made them.",
      "description": "# IntendedExperience\n\nAutomatically and temporarily sets effects, light color overrides and the BeatSaberPlus brightness override on a per-map basis to experience GLS maps and modcharts how they were intended.\n\nYour settings go back to normal after the map. For more info, check out the GitHub repository [README](https://github.com/Fatalution/BS_IntendedExperience#readme).\n\n**NOTE:** This mod only changes settings on GLS maps (v3/v4 environments, Weave and newer) and modcharts (Noodle Extensions, Mapping Extensions or Vivify).\n\n## Features\n\n- Separate settings for GLS maps and modcharts, each with:\n  - Enable All Effects → switches Off / No Flickering to All Effects\n  - Use Intended Colors → switches an All color override to Notes Only and turns on the map's SongCore environment colors\n  - Set Effects Brightness to 100% → resets BeatSaberPlus GameTweaker's brightness override\n- Hovering over the Play button shows what will change.\n- The IE button next to Play excludes a map.\n- Works with Heck's Settings Setter:\n  - Anything a map's Settings Setter controls is left to it.\n  - IE's changes are listed in its window to accept or decline.\n\n## Dependencies\n\n- BSIPA v4.3.0+\n- BeatSaberMarkupLanguage v1.14.1+ (v1.12.5+ on 1.40.8)\n- SiraUtil v3.3.1+ (v3.2.1+ on 1.40.8)\n- SongCore v3.16.0+ (v3.15.3+ on 1.40.8)\n- Optional: Heck for Settings Setter support, BeatSaberPlus GameTweaker for the brightness option",
      "category": "lighting",
      "author": "Fatalution",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/Fatalution/BS_IntendedExperience",
      "issuesUrl": "https://github.com/Fatalution/BS_IntendedExperience/issues",
